89
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:28,280
So before you graduate, 
I want you to exchange these cards

90
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:31,480
with at least three people you 
want to stay in touch with.

91
00:06:34,470 --> 00:06:39,490
<i>It's not like I have any friends. Can I 
give them to people outside of school?</i>

92
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:05,020
U-Um... Is this yours?

93
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:06,030
Oh!

94
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,570
Y-Yeah!

95
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:20,550
That card... We go to the same school, right?

96
00:07:21,050 --> 00:07:23,580
That old man isn't here with you today.

97
00:07:23,890 --> 00:07:25,840
<i>She talked to me!</i>

98
00:07:26,990 --> 00:07:29,910
U-Um, well...

99
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:35,460
Are you going to give that card to someone?

100
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:43,220
I-I don't have any... m-many friends, so...

101
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:47,580
Neither do I.

102
00:07:48,910 --> 00:07:53,730
I was worried I wouldn't have 
anyone to give my last one to.

103
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,870
If it's okay with you, want 
to exchange cards with me?

104
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:59,380
H-Huh?! Really?

105
00:08:03,410 --> 00:08:06,210
But I haven't filled mine out yet.

106
00:08:06,210 --> 00:08:09,860
That's okay! Just give it 
to me at school later.

107
00:08:10,960 --> 00:08:13,980
Can I just ask what your name is?

108
00:08:13,980 --> 00:08:17,510
Mine's Hotaru. Hinase Hotaru.

109
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:24,780
M-My name is Sa... Saki.

110
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:27,020
Sasaki-kun, huh?

111
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:29,200
<i>What?! That's not right!</i>

112
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:29,480
If I correct her now, it might embarrass her!

113
00:08:31,450 --> 00:08:34,840
Okay, I'll see you at school, Sasaki-kun!

114
00:08:39,490 --> 00:08:43,000
Name: Hinase Hotaru

115
