Eating yummy food from around the world

122
00:08:39,490 --> 00:08:43,000
Something I like

123
00:08:39,490 --> 00:08:43,000
Food
Fluffy things

124
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,030
Name: Hinase Hotaru

125
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,030
I don't have a cell phone.

126
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,030
Birthday

127
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,030
December 24th

128
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,030
Star Sign/Blood Type

129
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:51,030
Capricorn, Type O

130
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:57,240
<i>I wish... I wish I could get 
a girl like her to like me.</i>

131
00:08:57,920 --> 00:09:02,660
<i>I wish she could be my soulmate.</i>

132
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:12,920
<i>What should I do? It's already March, 
and I haven't given her my card yet.</i>

133
00:09:13,530 --> 00:09:16,160
<i>I want to give it to her when we're alone.</i>

134
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:18,530
Hey, isn't that Yao-kun?

135
00:09:18,530 --> 00:09:22,320
Oh, you're right! 
But who's that girl with him?

136
00:09:22,850 --> 00:09:24,410
Huh? No way!

137
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:39,680
Graduation day is

138
00:09:40,660 --> 00:09:45,180
<i>At this rate, I'm not going to get this
 to her before graduation.</i>

139
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:45,180
Name: Hananoi Saki

140
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:50,920
<i>Her shoes are still here!</i>

141
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:55,140
<i>Okay, I'll see you at school!</i>

142
00:09:58,990 --> 00:10:01,300
<i>If she's in the classroom, 
I'll give it to her.</i>

143
00:10:01,300 --> 00:10:03,700
<i>If she's in the classroom, 
I'll give it to her!</i>

144
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:06,750
<i>If she's in the classroom... 
I'll give it to her!</i>

145
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:14,950
I told you all about how I felt, Hotaru-chan!

146
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:17,020
<i>There's somebody else in there.</i>

147
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:21,220
I told you he was my dream. 
I told you I was really in love!

148
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:25,020
But you... But you...

149
00:10:25,410 --> 00:10:30,010
You didn't consider my feelings 
at all, Hotaru-chan.

150
00:10:55,310 --> 00:10:57,640
Oh? You sure are late.

151
00:10:58,110 --> 00:11:00,170
I thought you might not show up today.

152
00:11:01,230 --> 00:11:04,430
I'm... a horrible person.

153
00:11:04,430 --> 00:11:08,550
What's all this now? Did something 
bad happen at school?

154
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:12,520
I should have stopped it.

155
00:11:12,950 --> 00:11:17,320
I should have gotten a teacher. 
I should have tried to cheer her up.

156
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:20,760
I should have done something. I couldn't.

157
00:11:22,830 --> 00:11:28,100
Instead, I left her crying 
all by herself. I...

158
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,320
I...

159
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,180
I couldn't do anything for her!

160
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:48,320
I never should have started liking her!

161
00:11:49,820 --> 00:11:54,680
I don't know what happened, 
but have yourself a good cry, sonny.

162
00:11:55,860 --> 00:12:00,310
Despair is what teaches us how to grow up.

163
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:09,240
But you know, you shouldn't feel bad 
for liking her. That isn't right.

164
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:12,580
Love is something you just fall into.

165
00:12:13,830 --> 00:12:19,370
There's no such thing as someone
who shouldn't fall in love.

166
00:12:24,780 --> 00:12:26,180
<i>Thank you for your patience.</i>

167
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:29,960
<i>The train will arrive at 
platform one momentarily.</i>

168
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:35,450
Oh, s-sorry! When did I fall asleep?

169
00:12:35,450 --> 00:12:38,720
Good morning. It's totally okay.

170
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:41,200
It was a nice little bonus, honestly.

171
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:43,130
I'm just trying to process my joy.

172
00:12:43,130 --> 00:12:44,700
J-Joy?

173
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,870
Yeah. I'm happy.

174
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:53,350
<i>I never thought I'd ever see her again.</i>

175
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:59,190
<i>I never thought she'd talk to me again.</i>

176
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:02,380
Local Train

177
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:02,380
20 Minute Delay

178
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:02,380
Train will be arriving momentarily

179
00:13:02,390 --> 00:13:05,130
All right, I'll see you tomorrow.

180
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,320
Yeah.

181
00:13:11,550 --> 00:13:12,900
See you tomorrow.

182
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,220
Hmm?

183
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:19,680
No, I was just thinking about 
everything that happened today.

184
00:13:21,260 --> 00:13:25,620
Um, anyway, I look forward 
to keep seeing you tomorrow on, too!

185
00:13:26,170 --> 00:13:27,190
Sure.

186
00:13:27,710 --> 00:13:30,680
<i>I never thought we'd fall in love.</i>

187
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:38,130
<i>But actually, I never bothered to ask 
what happens after you're in love.</i>

188
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:43,250
<i>I was too focused on simply falling in love.</i>

189
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:51,080
<i>I never thought about what comes next.</i>

190
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:59,470
<i>My past is full of regrets. Will I ever 
be able to talk to you about that?</i>

191
00:14:00,730 --> 00:14:09,850
<i>If that day comes, this time, will I finally 
have become someone worthy of you?</i>

192
00:14:13,050 --> 00:14:17,910
Hananoi-kun, I tried making sweets today!

193
00:14:17,910 --> 00:14:20,850
Wow! I'm so happy!

194
00:14:22,470 --> 00:14:26,730
Hotaru-chan, you have some 
cream on your cheek.

195
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:39,190
I-I had another really weird dream!

196
00:14:40,050 --> 00:14:44,950
<i>The other day, Hananoi-kun and I 
had our first kiss.</i>

197
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:47,460
<i>The aftermath is intense!</i>

198
00:14:48,140 --> 00:14:49,370
Hotaru-chan?

199
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:52,120
Are you feeling down today?

200
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,710
N-No, not at all!

201
00:14:54,710 --> 00:14:57,720
Oh, the movie is gonna 
start soon. We should go!

202
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:00,070
You're right.

203
00:15:07,870 --> 00:15:12,150
<i>This isn't the first time we've held hands, 
but my heart always starts pounding!</i>

204
00:15:13,030 --> 00:15:17,100
<i>But it's more than excitement. 
I'm just so happy.</i>

205
00:15:17,890 --> 00:15:21,460
<i>Is this what it means to like someone?</i>

206
00:15:22,370 --> 00:15:26,200
<i>It's strange. I used to be
 so scared.</i>

207
00:15:26,890 --> 00:15:28,630
Hmm? Is something wrong?

208
00:15:28,630 --> 00:15:30,200
No.

209
00:15:32,670 --> 00:15:36,380
I'm just so happy right now!

210
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:06,530
Why are all of the rings 
here lined up in pairs?

211
00:16:06,530 --> 00:16:09,270
Oh, because they're for couples.

212
00:16:09,270 --> 00:16:10,670
They are?!

213
00:16:11,150 --> 00:16:13,140
Would you like to try one on?

214
00:16:13,140 --> 00:16:13,930
Huh?!

215
00:16:15,290 --> 00:16:16,800
Wow!

216
00:16:17,270 --> 00:16:21,290
If you put these rings together,
 they form a heart.

217
00:16:21,290 --> 00:16:22,910
Well, Hotaru-chan?

218
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:26,270
It's a very unfamiliar feeling!

219
00:16:26,270 --> 00:16:27,910
Unfamiliar, huh?

220
00:16:29,890 --> 00:16:33,180
<i>Maybe a simpler design would be better.</i>

221
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:42,180
U-Um, is this the sort of thing 
people wear when they're in love?

222
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:45,180
They're popular with students as well.

223
00:16:45,180 --> 00:16:49,540
B-But it might be a little too soon for us.

224
00:16:49,540 --> 00:16:54,750
Are you sure? I still think it's a lovely 
thing to celebrate your feelings.

225
00:16:57,690 --> 00:16:59,430
Do you like them after all?

226
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:04,580
If it's all right, I'd like 
to give you one as a present.

227
00:17:04,890 --> 00:17:08,840
N-No, that's okay. They seem expensive...

228
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:10,420
<i>They're </i>super<i> expensive!</i>

229
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:15,470
Please stop by again sometime!

230
00:17:20,710 --> 00:17:25,130
<i>I guess that was too much. 
Maybe a ring is overdoing it.</i>

231
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:34,650
Oh.

232
00:17:36,890 --> 00:17:38,360
Hotaru-chan?

233
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:52,540
S-Say, why don't we each buy 
matching ones here?

234
00:17:54,300 --> 00:17:55,680
Wow.

235
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:59,380
I've never worn a ring before.

236
00:17:59,380 --> 00:18:01,800
Let's be careful not to lose them, okay?

237
00:18:05,340 --> 00:18:06,690
I'm so happy.

238
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:11,770
I was worried this sort of thing 
would embarrass you, Hotaru-chan.

239
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:17,480
I don't know. It's kind of nice to 
commemorate our feelings like this.

240
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:27,290
I never knew what this felt like.

241
00:18:27,290 --> 00:18:28,030
Huh?

242
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,540
That just holding hands could be so exciting.

243
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:37,260
The desire to make 
someone dear to you smile.

244
00:18:37,760 --> 00:18:42,510
Or how much courage it takes
to confess your feelings to someone.

245
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:50,060
I don't ever want to forget how that feels.

246
00:18:53,590 --> 00:18:58,560
As long as I'm wearing this, 
I'll remember whenever I look at it.

247
00:18:59,350 --> 00:19:03,080
Oh! I'm a bit embarrassed I said that...

248
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,320
No, not at all.

249
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:24,630
Not even a little.

250
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:31,840
It sure is funny, though. 
I was so scared of falling in love.

251
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:39,080
Hananoi-kun, you taught me what love is.

252
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:40,190
Thank you!

253
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:53,350
I'm the one who's grateful.

254
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:01,600
For falling in love with me...

255
